{% comment %}
  IQ Dogsport Spin & Win — Online + Onsite

  Customer page:
  /pages/gluecksrad

  Staff page:
  /pages/gluecksrad?staff=1

  Campaign ends:
  Sunday, 2 August 2026 at 23:59 Europe/Berlin

  Active Shopify prize codes:
  VDHRED2026
  VDHWHITE2026
  VDHBLACK2026
  VDHCLICKWHITE2026

  Google Apps Script actions:
  register
  spin
  claim
  redeem
{% endcomment %}

